# The Hobbes engine ignores its own secrets and artifacts, so the drop-in is
# self-contained — no per-client root .gitignore editing, nothing to forget.

# Python build artifacts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# The PSI key — never commit (it was historically tracked; rotate if exposed)
tools/.psi-key

# Cycle build intermediate — raw/ is the machine source the tools write and
# findings.py parses; the capture tools print their sections to stdout for
# baseline.py to assemble into 01-baseline.md, so there's no *-results.md digest
# to ignore anymore. raw/ isn't a durable deliverable, so it stays out of git to
# keep the repo from ballooning. The durable record is 01-baseline.md,
# 02-evaluation.md, plan.md, execution.md.
cycle/*/raw/
